      "notes": "Foundational description of the dialect. §6b: the retroflex non-trilled 'r caipira'. §6a: laminodental coda /s/, no chiado. §22a: coda /l/ -> r rhotacism. §23a: word-final /r/ elision. §25/§6e: /ʎ/ vocalisation. §8: early-20c retention of final unstressed /e/, /o/ (no raising)."
